        <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-8 text-on-surface tracking-tight">
          Our Roots in Undisan
        </h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            D'karang Eco Lodge sits along Jalan Raya Besakih in Undisan, a hillside village in the
            Bangli regency of Bali. The road to Besakih — Bali's holiest temple — runs past our
            garden gate, placing you at the meeting point of culture, nature, and quietude.
          </p>
          <p>
            We built this place as a homestay, not a hotel. That distinction matters. Guests share
            in the rhythms of village life: the smell of morning offerings, the sound of gamelan
            practice drifting through the trees, meals cooked with real ingredients in a real
            kitchen.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our outdoor pool, sun terrace, coffee shop, and halal restaurant grew from the same
            intention — to give you comfort without pulling you away from the place itself.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
